{% doc %}
  Renders one accessible accordion row (native `<details>/<summary>`, no JS,
  no hidden-checkbox trick) for the Montibello PDP's PRODUCT INFORMATION
  section. Keyboard-operable and exposes expanded/collapsed state natively
  via the `details` element — no `display:none` control dependency. Closed
  by default (no `open` attribute). Caller is responsible for checking the
  underlying metafield is present before rendering — this snippet does not
  hide itself.

  @param {string} label - the closed-state row label, e.g. "Cómo usar"
  @param {string} content - pre-rendered HTML/rich text content to reveal
{% enddoc %}

<details class="montibello-pdp-accordion-item">
  <summary class="montibello-pdp-accordion-item__label">
    {{ label }}
    <span class="montibello-pdp-accordion-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </summary>
  <div class="montibello-pdp-accordion-item__content">{{ content }}</div>
</details>

{%- comment -%}
  Styling for `.montibello-pdp-accordion-item*` lives in the CSS of whichever
  section renders this snippet (`montibello-product-details.liquid`) —
  the stylesheet tag is only valid in section/block files, not snippets.
{%- endcomment -%}
